WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:01.668
As you can see, it's a really great neighborhood.

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:05.505
Oh, yeah. It's a great part of the market. 
–The house has great bones.

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:10.176
Oh.

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:11.469
I'm sorry, would you excuse me?

00:00:11.469 --> 00:00:12.429
What the hell happened?

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:13.513
Hit and run.

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.473
I'm never going in that Walmart again.

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:24.691
We supported you while Mommy was here,

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:26.109
but ain't happening anymore.

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:29.070
I told you,

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:30.697
I'm a private investigator now.

00:00:32.073 --> 00:00:34.159
You're just gonna have to hustle.

00:00:34.159 --> 00:00:35.577
I need a hustle.

00:00:35.577 --> 00:00:37.662
No, "to" hustle.

00:00:37.662 --> 00:00:39.247
This is the time, Pegs.

00:00:39.247 --> 00:00:40.874
You're a phoenix, baby.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:41.750
I know.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:44.878
What are you supposed to be?

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:45.754
A real P.I.

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:47.130
What are you playing at?

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:48.339
I'm not hiring.

00:00:48.339 --> 00:00:50.175
I'm a natural detective.

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:52.218
You need me, and I need this job.

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:55.305
Be here Monday morning at 9 a.m.

00:00:55.305 --> 00:00:56.806
I don't get up before 11.

00:00:57.766 --> 00:00:59.392
When I have money, we all had money.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:00.935
From dealing drugs!

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.146
It was a little pot.

00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:04.189
Maybe some hash.

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:05.356
There was cocaine.

00:01:05.356 --> 00:01:06.399
Well, that was much later.

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:07.942
And I did it, I didn't sell it.

00:01:07.942 --> 00:01:09.402
Oh, wow.

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:10.028
Okay, calm down!

00:01:11.654 --> 00:01:12.739
Good comes from bad,

00:01:12.989 --> 00:01:15.784
but I need that thing
that I've always missed.

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:18.912
I got some oxy?

00:01:20.205 --> 00:01:21.247
No!

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:24.334
I'm on methadone, creep.

00:01:24.334 --> 00:01:26.878
You don't think things are going to change that fact?

00:01:29.214 --> 00:01:30.256
But they do.

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:36.054
I worry that the next time I come out here
is going to be for my sister's funeral.

00:01:36.304 --> 00:01:38.348
Fire in the hole!

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:41.976
You’re at the point of no return.

00:01:44.395 --> 00:01:48.024
The scope of this thing
could put us on the map.

00:01:52.987 --> 00:01:53.947
What?

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:55.406
What are you looking at?

00:01:55.406 --> 00:01:56.199
Get out of here.

00:01:56.199 --> 00:01:57.617
[ENGINE SPUTTERS]

